      "rendered": "<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/tiles_004_render.jpg?w=800&#038;ssl=1\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/tiles_004_render.jpg\" class=\" lazyload\"></p>\n<h3>Tiles&nbsp;004</h3>\n<p>Seamless texture, 2048&nbsp;x 2048, with the following maps:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Specularity</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1S5IZ0FYUsEDrEXmxy7rZhIaFwIgI8Naw?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOWNLOAD ALL THE MAPS</a></strong></p>\n<p>As always it’s a free texture, you can do whatever you want with it. Just don’t be a prick a tell it’s yours.</p>\n<p>If you like my work and you find it good enough to use on your work, consider giving me a small tip using the right&nbsp;menu and in return I’ll provide you a link to the folder where I have all my textures and you can download them all with a single click.</p>\n<p>Take care and be around, I’ll be posting more soon.</p>\n",
